--- a/dwm.1
+++ b/dwm.1
@@ -93,6 +93,14 @@ Focus next window.
 .B Mod1\-k
 Focus previous window.
 .TP
+.B Mod1\-Shift\-j
+Move the focused window down the stack: it swaps places with the next tiled
+window, and from the bottom with the master.
+.TP
+.B Mod1\-Shift\-k
+Move the focused window up the stack: it swaps places with the previous tiled
+window, and from the master with the bottom one.
+.TP
 .B Mod1\-i
 Increase number of windows in master area.
